ck proceeds to  place the 10 commandments inside the  body of Zell dress and presumably after  the required amount of time has passed  and not as instantly as it appears in  the chapter Zell dress emerges from the  cocoon  it seems that Cusack did not know what  zelgius meliodas and the others learned  just a few chapters earlier absorbing  all of the commandments doesn't make you  more powerful than the demon king it  merely makes the one who absorbs the  commandments a new vessel that the demon  king can take control of as the new  demon king zelgius emerges he  immediately destroys cusack simply  because he considers cusack to be  nauseating now in a new adult form just  like meliodas had been when he was  possessed by the demon king the new  demon king zelgius is born it is now  clear that instead of being defeated the  demon king has been resurrected yet  again  and now inside a brand-new vessel and  the next chapter chapter 312 is called  the war begins yes you heard that right  after all those epilogues and happy  ending chapters the next chapter is  going to be called the war begins Wow  this is such a troll I can't even anyway  to me this definitely seems like the  setup for a brand new demon king zelgius  Ark and even more arcs could be coming  in the future if the supreme deity ever  decides to stop chilling in the  celestial realm and that's without  taking into consideration the potential  for entirely new kingdoms and villains  potentially being introduced in the  future at this point I'm honestly  starting to think that na kvass Tsuzuki  may have changed his mind about ending  the series after all in recent years the  seven deadly sins has become an  extremely profitable and popular series  both in Japan and in the West and this  might have something to do with what is  now happening in the manga because to me  this feels like a total restart rather  than an ending and if naka bouzouki  really has changed his mind and he wants  to keep this story goin